    "flavor_text": {
        "ruby": "MANECTRIC is constantly discharging electricity from its mane. The sparks sometimes ignite forest fires. When it enters a battle, this POKéMON creates thunderclouds.",
        "sapphire": "MANECTRIC discharges strong electricity from its mane. The mane is used for collecting electricity in the atmosphere. This POKéMON creates thunderclouds above its head.",
        "emerald": "Because lightning falls in their vicinities, MANECTRIC were thought to have been born from lightning. In battle, they create thunderclouds.",
        "firered": "It rarely appears before people. It is said to nest where lightning has fallen.",
        "leafgreen": "It rarely appears before people. It is said to nest where lightning has fallen."
    },
